    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "ESxwy",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3550,
      "name": "Nota App / 08. FEED SOCIAL CONTÍNUO & SCHEMA DRIZZLE",
      "width": 390,
      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "stroke": "#E4E4E7",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 8,
      "padding": 18,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tx_41b",
          "name": "Note Title",
          "fill": "#09090B",
          "content": "08. FEED SOCIAL CONTÍNUO & SCHEMA DRIZZLE",
          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tx_41c",
          "name": "Note Body",
          "fill": "#52525B",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Alinhamento Direto ao Schema: Cada card no feed mapeia 1:1 a tabela 'journalEntries' (content, date, liked, entryType: 'post' | 'reply' | 'repost' e moodId -> moods).\n• Relações Pivot no Card: 'entryThoughts' (pensamentos com 💭), 'entryEmotions' (emoções com ❤️) e 'entryReactions' (reações/ações com ⚡).\n• Sem Truncamento: O conteúdo é totalmente legível no fluxo contínuo. A psicóloga desliza o feed sem tocar para abrir telas filhas e sem perder a posição de scroll.\n• Filtros no Topo: Pílulas que filtram por moods, thoughts, emotions, reactions ou liked diretamente no SQLite local.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Hctoz",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 3550,
      "name": "Nota App / 09. NOVO REGISTRO DE TCC",
      "width": 390,
      "fill": "#FFFFFF",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "stroke": "#E4E4E7",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 8,
      "padding": 18,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "M65zw8",
          "name": "Note Title",
          "fill": "#09090B",
          "content": "09. NOVO REGISTRO DE TCC",
          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "W0If2",
          "name": "Note Body",
          "fill": "#52525B",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Conecta todas as tabelas do seu schema.ts em uma única tela fluida:\n  1. moods + moodScore\n  2. entry_emotions\n  3. entry_thoughts\n  4. entry_reactions\n  5. content (texto livre)",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
